        "html": "<div class=\"rm-valuegrid\"><div class=\"rm-value\"><h3>Billing terms change everything</h3><p>The same product can cost 2–3× more month-to-month than on annual or two-year billing. We show the term next to every price.</p></div><div class=\"rm-value\"><h3>Per-person beats per-plan</h3><p>A $5.99/mo family plan for 6 people ($0.92/person at 1Password regular pricing) can beat a $3.99 individual plan per head. We do the math on use-case pages.</p></div><div class=\"rm-value\"><h3>Free tiers are not equal</h3><p>Bitwarden's free tier is unlimited in passwords and devices; NordPass's free tier limits you to one device. 'Free' needs reading.</p></div><div class=\"rm-value\"><h3>First-year promos revert</h3><p>1Password's $2.99/mo is a first-year rate for new customers; year two is $3.99/mo. Deals pages that hide the regular price aren't deals pages.</p></div></div>"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh00000427",
       "elType": "widget",
