     "elements": [
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042a",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "heading",
       "settings": {
        "title": "How we research",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "align": "left"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>No fabricated testing. No invented numbers. Here is the actual pipeline behind every page.</p>"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042c",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<div class=\"rm-steps\"><div class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step__n\">01</div><h3>Define the decision</h3><p>We start from what people are actually trying to decide — the questions, not the products.</p></div><div class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step__n\">02</div><h3>Verify at the source</h3><p>Pricing and plan facts are checked on official vendor pages, with the verification date stamped on the page.</p></div><div class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step__n\">03</div><h3>Corroborate everything else</h3><p>Features, security claims, and audit history require the vendor's own documentation or multiple independent sources.</p></div><div class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step__n\">04</div><h3>Write the decision, not the brochure</h3><p>Every page must answer: who is this for, who should avoid it, what it costs, what's limited, and what's the alternative.</p></div><div class=\"rm-step\"><div class=\"rm-step__n\">05</div><h3>Date, disclose, re-verify</h3><p>Prices are re-checked on a ≤45-day cycle; deals degrade from 'Verified' if not re-checked within 30 days. Corrections are public.</p></div></div>"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042d",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "heading",
       "settings": {
        "title": "How we evaluate",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "align": "left"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042e",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>Criteria are transparent. Numeric scores are withheld until a genuine scoring methodology exists — which is why you won't see fake stars here.</p>"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh0000042f",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "html",
       "settings": {
        "html": "<div class=\"rm-criteria\"><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Security architecture</h3><p>Encryption approach, zero-knowledge design, known audits (as documented by vendors and auditors)</p></div><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Price & value</h3><p>Verified pricing across billing terms, per-person math for plans, free-tier honesty</p></div><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Ease of use</h3><p>Onboarding friction, autofill quality, cross-platform consistency — based on documented user experience evidence</p></div><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Trust & transparency</h3><p>Open source status, breach history, jurisdiction, corporate transparency</p></div><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Feature completeness</h3><p>Passkeys, 2FA authenticator, secure sharing, emergency access, breach alerts</p></div><div class=\"rm-criterion\"><h3>Recovery & sharing</h3><p>Emergency access, family controls, inheritance — where real life happens</p></div></div>"
       },
       "elements": []
      },
      {
       "id": "rmh00000430",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p class='rm-disclosure'>Our reviews are research-based. We have not conducted hands-on laboratory testing; where we characterize user experience, we rely on documented evidence and label it as such. Learn more on the How We Evaluate page.</p>"
       },
       "elements": []
