       "settings": {
        "html": "<div class=\"rm-grid rm-grid--3\"><a class=\"rm-card\" href=\"/guides/free-vs-paid-password-managers/\"><div class=\"rm-card__cat\">Guide</div><div class=\"rm-card__title\">Free vs paid password managers</div><div class=\"rm-card__body\">What each free tier really includes in 2026 — and the four moments when paying pays off.</div></a><a class=\"rm-card\" href=\"/guides/password-manager-vs-browser-autofill/\"><div class=\"rm-card__cat\">Guide</div><div class=\"rm-card__title\">Password manager vs browser autofill</div><div class=\"rm-card__body\">Why the convenience of built-in autofill is the exact reason security teams say don't rely on it.</div></a><a class=\"rm-card\" href=\"/best/password-managers/\"><div class=\"rm-card__cat\">Guide</div><div class=\"rm-card__title\">Best password managers (pillar)</div><div class=\"rm-card__body\">The full decision framework with verified prices and situation-based picks.</div></a></div>"
