        "html": "<div class=\"rm-newsletter\"><div><h2>Get smarter buying decisions in your inbox</h2><p>One considered email when it matters: a new comparison, a verified price change, or a deal that clears our verification bar. No filler, no fake urgency.</p><ul><li>New comparisons and verdicts</li><li>Price changes that actually matter</li><li>Verified deals only — with the check date</li></ul></div><div class=\"rm-newsletter__right\"><form class=\"rm-newsletter__form\" action=\"/\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"email\" name=\"rmh_newsletter_email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required aria-label=\"Email address\"><button class=\"rm-btn rm-btn--cta\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></form><p class=\"rm-fineprint\">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime. We do not sell your address.</p></div></div>"
